# OpenSpec integration lives in the universal .agents/skills location (Kilo and
# other agents load it automatically) plus Kilo slash commands. It is generator
# output: rewritten by `openspec update`, cannot be hand-split, so it is exempt
# from the global agent-size-guard, whose 20 000-byte limit targets authored files.
.agents/skills/openspec-*/** linguist-generated
.kilo/command/** linguist-generated
